umbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102591","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"57476","synopsis":"Rescued by her \"sister\" Liang-Chi, and now taking her place of power as the leader of the terrorist organization Snake, Alphard sets a trap for Canaan, luring her out into the open at a glamorous state dinner. Once there, Alphard reveals she and Canaan have more in common than Canaan ever let on.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dBYJjAZlMSj17PAoeFdhKeDKO3B.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Rescued by her \"sister\" Liang-Chi, and now taking her place of power as the leader of the terrorist organization Snake, Alphard sets a trap for Canaan, luring her out into the open at a glamorous state dinner. Once there, Alphard reveals she and Canaan have more in common than Canaan ever let on.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dBYJjAZlMSj17PAoeFdhKeDKO3B.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6275","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5356","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5356","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"43418","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102591","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"57477","synopsis":"As Alphard makes preparations for her attack on the global anti-terrorism conference, Liang-Chi devises plans of her own. Blackmailing Yun Yun with the threat of withholding medication she needs to survive, Liang-Chi coerces her into killing Canaan, using Maria as bait. Meanwhile, Minorikawa attempts to get closer to the mysterious Hakko, despite Santana's efforts to keep them apart.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jN4lmBqWoi9vnWSpORcpSS2KShO.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"As Alphard makes preparations for her attack on the global anti-terrorism conference, Liang-Chi devises plans of her own. Blackmailing Yun Yun with the threat of withholding medication she needs to survive, Liang-Chi coerces her into killing Canaan, using Maria as bait. Meanwhile, Minorikawa attempts to get closer to the mysterious Hakko, despite Santana's efforts to keep them apart.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jN4lmBqWoi9vnWSpORcpSS2KShO.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6275","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5356","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5356","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"43418","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102591","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"57478","synopsis":"Minorikawa and Maria receive an invitation to attend the anti-terrorism conference, but it's only a ruse by Alphard to lure Canaan to the summit. Once there, Liang-Chi and Alphard launch their attack, sealing the world's key diplomats in an office chamber, infecting them with the Ua virus--and causing Canaan to rescue Maria, putting her own life in danger.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hdW3tEkVsfim4vlwlCQyMPzRBip.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Minorikawa and Maria receive an invitation to attend the anti-terrorism conference, but it's only a ruse by Alphard to lure Canaan to the summit. Once there, Liang-Chi and Alphard launch their attack, sealing the world's key diplomats in an office chamber, infecting them with the Ua virus--and causing Canaan to rescue Maria, putting her own life in danger.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hdW3tEkVsfim4vlwlCQyMPzRBip.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6275","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5356","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5356","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"43418","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102591","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"57479","synopsis":"After the Ua virus is unleashed, infecting world leaders, the global governments have no choice but to allow Alphard to drop a bomb on the anti-terrorism conference, killing millions. But as Alphard deals with the US government, Canaan sneaks into the summit to rescue the captive Maria and stop the imminent air strike.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/86p3s9ShtstQ2RW8j05hXLLih3E.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"After the Ua virus is unleashed, infecting world leaders, the global governments have no choice but to allow Alphard to drop a bomb on the anti-terrorism conference, killing millions. But as Alphard deals with the US government, Canaan sneaks into the summit to rescue the captive Maria and stop the imminent air strike.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/86p3s9ShtstQ2RW8j05hXLLih3E.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6275","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5356","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5356","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"43418","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102591","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"57480","synopsis":"After Alphard chooses Canaan over Liang-Chi, the spurned terrorist breaks off and vows to exact a terrible revenge. Meanwhile, Minorikawa confronts Santana, and is at last allowed to get answers from the mysterious Hakko. Canaan tries to adapt to the fact that she has lost her powers.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/he3FbwC5roPwaapOLi2SrXylUIA.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"After Alphard chooses Canaan over Liang-Chi, the spurned terrorist breaks off and vows to exact a terrible revenge. Meanwhile, Minorikawa confronts Santana, and is at last allowed to get answers from the mysterious Hakko. Canaan tries to adapt to the fact that she has lost her powers.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/he3FbwC5roPwaapOLi2SrXylUIA.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6275","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5356","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5356","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"43418","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102591","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"57481","synopsis":"Canaan, Maria, Santana, Hakko, and Minorikawa head to the desert to discover the secrets of the Factory. Once there, Santana confesses his involvement in the massacre, and Hakko reacts with dangerous emotion. Possessed by jealousy and descending into madness, Liang-Chi makes a deadly attack but finds her rage thwarted by a surprising adversary.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4jh8itLNK1B99tstaRUENjQQ79T.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"Canaan, Maria, Santana, Hakko, and Minorikawa head to the desert to discover the secrets of the Factory. Once there, Santana confesses his involvement in the massacre, and Hakko reacts with dangerous emotion. Possessed by jealousy and descending into madness, Liang-Chi makes a deadly attack but finds her rage thwarted by a surprising adversary.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4jh8itLNK1B99tstaRUENjQQ79T.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6275","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5356","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5356","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"43418","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102591","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"57482","synopsis":"When they enter the Factory's deepest chambers, Canaan, Maria, and the others find the diseased survivors of the horrible experiment. There, Hakko is confronted with her own horrible past, which gives Liang-Chi the advantage she needs to attack the group from within.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bKqSvmQVOeTSm0cChWXsQwzpkva.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"When they enter the Factory's deepest chambers, Canaan, Maria, and the others find the diseased survivors of the horrible experiment. There, Hakko is confronted with her own horrible past, which gives Liang-Chi the advantage she needs to attack the group from within.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bKqSvmQVOeTSm0cChWXsQwzpkva.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6275","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5356","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5356","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"43418","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102591","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"57483","synopsis":"As Liang-Chi's subversive plan takes a